WEBVTT

00:08:29.188 --> 00:08:30.358
with those people.

00:08:30.382 --> 00:08:31.535
SC: Yeah.

00:08:31.559 --> 00:08:33.851
CA: Whereas the introvert
may or may not be shy,

00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:36.500
they may actually be quite good
at the initial hello,

00:08:36.524 --> 00:08:42.462
but within half an hour, are feeling
stress inside and wanting to retreat.

00:08:42.486 --> 00:08:43.668
Is that the difference?

00:08:43.692 --> 00:08:45.429
SC: Yeah, it’s something like that.

00:08:45.453 --> 00:08:46.932
The only thing I would say is,

00:08:46.956 --> 00:08:49.741
the question of, are you good
at the initial hello or not,

00:08:49.765 --> 00:08:51.119
could kind of go either way.

00:08:51.143 --> 00:08:53.671
Because, I think of how you do
with the initial hello

00:08:53.695 --> 00:08:56.644
in many ways has to do with a social skill

00:08:56.668 --> 00:09:00.917
that a child and then later an adult
sort of acquires over time.